---
const links = [
  { href: '/yuanqi', label: '缘起' },
  { href: '/tixi', label: '体系' },
  { href: '/zhufa', label: '祝法' },
  { href: '/chuancheng', label: '传承' },
  { href: '/kecheng', label: '课程' },
  { href: '/wenda', label: '问答' },
  { href: '/baoming', label: '报名' },
];
---

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="foot-top">
      <div class="foot-brand">
        <span class="seal" style="font-size:1.3rem;">祝</span>
        <div>
          <h2 class="kai">上古祝门</h2>
          <p>古巫祝脉 · 隐传至今 · 半显于世</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="foot-links">
        {
          links.map((l) => (
            <a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>
          ))
        }
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="foot-note">
      <p>
        本网站所载内容系巫祝养生理论传承，未经科学证实，切勿迷信。敬告：修行之事无凭，仅供作为一项爱好，研究古代巫祝养生之用。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="foot-bottom">
      <p>© 上古祝门 · 古巫祝脉</p>
      <p class="foot-motto kai">祝，咒也 · 天人合一 · 万物一咒</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .foot {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-line);
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem) 0 2.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4));
  }

  html[data-theme='light'] .foot {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04));
  }

  .foot-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .foot-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .foot-brand h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.35em;
    color: var(--heading);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .foot-brand p {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    color: var(--bone-faint);
  }

  .foot-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.8rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .foot-links a {
    font-family: var(--font-kai);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--bone-dim);
    transition: color 0.3s var(--ease-soft);
  }

  .foot-links a:hover {
    color: var(--bronze-bright);
  }

  .foot-note {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-line);
    padding-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  .foot-note p {
    color: var(--bone-faint);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 2.1;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    max-width: 54em;
  }

  .foot-bottom {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--bone-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  }

  .foot-motto {
    color: var(--bronze-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
  }
</style>